==Trivia==
* In the VIZ Media second edition of {{PAV|3}}, the "next volume preview" page's cover artwork for volume four does not match the artwork used in the final version.

===Errors===
* Yellow says that [[Pika]] is weak against {{type|Water}} Pokémon, even though {{type|Electric}}s like Pikachu are strong against Water Pokémon.
* In the {{pmin|Brazil|Brazilian Portuguese}} translation, [[Silph Co.]] is called ''Sylph Co.'' on the back cover.

====VIZ Media first edition====
* Experience points are incorrectly named "Number."

====VIZ Media second edition====
* On the "main characters" page, all of the [[Gym Leader]]s are all labelled incorrectly. Brock is identified as Lt. Surge, Misty is identified as Koga,  Erika is identified as Sabrina and {{adv|Blaine}} is identified as Giovanni.
* The same page also has {{adv|Green}}'s {{p|Blastoise}} wrongly translated as {{p|Squirtle}}.

==Translation edits==
*In the VIZ Media first edition as well as [[The Best of Pokémon Adventures: Yellow]], ''[[PS045|Cloystered]]'' is split into two chapters - "Cloystered" and "Raging Rattata".
*In the VIZ Media second edition the {{p|Jynx}} on the back cover was altered from its original, changing its original black design to the current purple one. This is likely due to the [[Pokémon controversies#Jynx|controversy surrounding the character]].
**This change was also reproduced in more recent Japanese reprints, although with a different shading.

